{"slug":"a-t-y","ar":"ء ت ي","total":549,"core":"coming; giving","forms":[{"ar":"آتَى","kind":"verb","form":4,"count":271,"gloss":"To give","word":"aata","ex":{"s":37,"a":117,"p":1,"ar":["وَءَاتَيْنَـٰهُمَا","ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","ٱلْمُسْتَبِينَ"],"en":"And We gave them the explicit Scripture"}},{"ar":"أَتَى","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":264,"gloss":"To come; to come to, reach","word":"ata","ex":{"s":74,"a":47,"p":2,"ar":["حَتَّىٰٓ","أَتَىٰنَا","ٱلْيَقِينُ"],"en":"Until there came to us the certainty"}},{"ar":"آتِي","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":9,"gloss":"coming, sure to come","word":null,"ex":{"s":19,"a":95,"p":2,"ar":["وَكُلُّهُمْ","ءَاتِيهِ","يَوْمَ","ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","فَرْدًا"],"en":"And all of them are coming to Him on the Day of Resurrection alone"}},{"ar":"إِيتَاءٌ","kind":"verbal noun","form":4,"count":3,"gloss":"giving","word":null,"ex":{"s":21,"a":73,"p":11,"ar":["وَجَعَلْنَـٰهُمْ","أَئِمَّةً","يَهْدُونَ","بِأَمْرِنَا","وَأَوْحَيْنَآ","إِلَيْهِمْ","فِعْلَ","ٱلْخَيْرَٰتِ","وَإِقَامَ","ٱلصَّلَوٰةِ","وَإِيتَآءَ","ٱلزَّكَوٰةِ ۖ","وَكَانُوا۟","لَنَا","عَـٰبِدِينَ"],"en":"And We made them leaders guiding by Our command. And We inspired to them the doing of good deeds, establishment of prayer, and giving of zakah; and they were worshippers of Us"}},{"ar":"مَأْتِيٌّ","kind":"passive participle","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"fulfilled, bound to come","word":null,"ex":{"s":19,"a":61,"p":11,"ar":["جَنَّـٰتِ","عَدْنٍ","ٱلَّتِى","وَعَدَ","ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنُ","عِبَادَهُۥ","بِٱلْغَيْبِ ۚ","إِنَّهُۥ","كَانَ","وَعْدُهُۥ","مَأْتِيًّا"],"en":"[Therein are] gardens of perpetual residence which the Most Merciful has promised His servants in the unseen. Indeed, His promise has ever been coming"}},{"ar":"مُؤْتُون","kind":"active participle","form":4,"count":1,"gloss":"givers","word":null,"ex":{"s":4,"a":162,"p":17,"ar":["لَّـٰكِنِ","ٱلرَّٰسِخُونَ","فِى","ٱلْعِلْمِ","مِنْهُمْ","وَٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","يُؤْمِنُونَ","بِمَآ","أُنزِلَ","إِلَيْكَ","وَمَآ","أُنزِلَ","مِن","قَبْل